      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm looking for some advice on pallet stacking for our high-density racking in the Rotterdam facility. We're dealing with some heavy industrial loads that have uneven weight distribution. What's the best way to handle the center of gravity when stacking these to prevent tipping in the racks?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
